        "notes": "Round 1 is a very run of the mill Mercy selection.  We pick  [Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb) as it's VITAL to any Mercy build (I feel naked without it).\n\nFor Commons, WP and AS are gonna be our top priority to farm as much cash as possible.  Pick either  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) or  [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) depending on team comps.  \n\n\u27e1 If your other support is a weak healer or inconsistent, having the quicker self heal from First Aid Kit is good. \n\n\u27e1 If you're facing an ashe or a cass I would recommend taking the armor instead for the damage reduction it provides.",
