        "notes": "Round 2 is going to be similiar to round 1.  You want to farm as much cash as possible so you have enough cushion for your first epic item in round 3.\n\nItems:\n\n\u27e1 I'll typically sell  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) and buy  [Angeleisure Wear](item_00b53ed7-0768-442b-a2c3-8d19608c9391) if I can afford it.  If I can't afford it keeping Armored Vest is fine, so long as I can buy two rares.\n\n\u27e1 For rares  [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) and  [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) are a good base to build off of.  If you're rich, you may consider buying  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) over Adv. Nanobiotics.",
