        "notes": "Round 3 grab  [Crepuscular Circle](item_c0b93ed2-b692-44d5-a38a-ce5a63e83cdb) for the increased aggression (even if you can't aim it's ok).  I tried so hard to give up this power but I can't hide from it anymore.  It feels like I'm throwing if I don't get it.\n\n\u27e1 Optionally you CAN get  [Serenity](item_c6e1c072-ff50-467e-b59f-9506baea10c1) if you're struggling to get peel from your teammates.  This power pairs really well with  [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) which is going to be our first epic.\n\nItems:\n\n\u27e1 Grab  [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) for the increased movement speed and AS.  I love this item and it would feel wrong to even consider a different Epic this round.",
