        "notes": "By round 4 you should be seeing a huge spike in earnings and start to feel a bit more comfortable with getting more expensive Rare items.\n\nItems:\n\n\u27e1  [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) should be your next Epic pick.  With this build especially, having the added burst of WP to crit allies really starts to shine here and is a good warmup to Triage.\n\n\u27e1 I would recommend selling  [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) and buying  [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) at this point.  If you can afford to keep it, awesome, but if you still have $4k available I suggest a survival item like  [Angeleisure Wear](item_00b53ed7-0768-442b-a2c3-8d19608c9391) instead of Adv. Nanobiotics.",
