        "notes": "Round 6 is a funky round.  You either have enough money for all Epics or you're in a weird \"I'm 200 shy\" area.\n\nThis round is pretty straightforward, fight for your life and hopefully you win after this.\n\nFor items I usually start looking into CD reduction as res and quick GAs start to become a lot more vital to winning fights.\n\n\u27e1 [Resurrection Rangefinder](item_99baffec-51b5-42e4-be61-e29f3de8219f) and  [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) are gonna be my go-to for survivability and CD reduction.  \n\n\u27e1 If you can afford to pick up a 7th epic, awesome, grab something like  [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) to secure kills in valk or  [Chain Evoker](item_812cc89e-feb0-47d0-9e03-9d8e33a80aca) to apply stronger damage boost to your teammates.  \n\n\u27e1 Another potential option is  [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448), but I struggle with getting the most out of the special effect without   [Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5) so I would only pick it up for the additional WP and getting your CD reduction to 30% (makes res a 20s cd).",
